      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It is completely understandable that you feel this way when the cycle feels relentless and unchanging. That sense of being stuck in a meaningless loop is exhausting. While the feeling of waiting is overwhelming right now, sometimes the deepest, most profound changes happen when we allow ourselves to be truly seen in our pain. Even if it feels impossible to imagine, there are ways to shift the focus from just waiting for it to stop to finding one small thing that offers a moment of relief.",
      "source": "target",
